          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "Tauri desktop application for recursive diagrams, rich documentation and audience-specific saved views."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "Renderer → domain transactions → typed Tauri bridge → native files and local MCP."
